  "question": {
    "text": "The value of acceleration due to gravity at Earth&#39;s surface is <math><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>9.8</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> . The altitude above its surface at which the acceleration due to gravity decreases to <math><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>4.9</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>,&nbsp;is close to: (Radius of earth <math><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6.4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> )",
